      "seed": 403720859,
      "version": 562,
      "versionNonce": 283609019,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785388958883,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Just like paramaterized methods programmer can also \ncreate paramaterized constructor.\n\n2. Paramaterized constrructor accepts the arguement.\n\n3. There is rule with parameterized contructor that\nwhile calling the constructor during object creation \nit must also be parametrized with same arg list and order.\n\n----->> 11Account.java\n\nIn this way different object can have different field value.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Just like paramaterized methods programmer can also \ncreate paramaterized constructor.\n\n2. Paramaterized constrructor accepts the arguement.\n\n3. There is rule with parameterized contructor that\nwhile calling the constructor during object creation \nit must also be parametrized with same arg list and order.\n\n----->> 11Account.java\n\nIn this way different object can have different field value.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
